        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Version 1.0 finally live!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2506440/extras/94e058697553d91f123bb054dc7e01d7.poster.avif?t=1767655503\" width=600 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2506440/extras/94e058697553d91f123bb054dc7e01d7.webm?t=1767655503\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Old-school 2D fantasy open world MMORPG</strong></i> - all the basic stuff you'd expect, monsters, loot, player trading, auction houses, achievements, guilds, professions, and so on. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>5 classes</strong></i> - play as a fighter, a priest, a sorcerer, a paladin, or a witch, each with 3 unique talent trees and 150+ talents in total.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>350+ quests</strong></i> - you can reach maximum levels by doing quests, solo or in a party.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>8 instance dungeons</strong></i> - bring friends to tackle these challenges for unique rare loot.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Optional PVP</strong></i> - don't worry, you won't be ganked.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>No pay-to-win (ever!)</strong></i> - the price of the game is what you see on the tin.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Mix of handcrafted and generated worlds and dungeons</strong></i> - every day Junjun the Portal Master will open up a gateway to another world that has never been visited before. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Gods and deities</strong></i> - discover new deities, show your allegiance to them and they'll reward you. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Optional offline mode and custom servers</strong></i> - play locally without internet connection or run your own servers. </p></li></ul>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Version 1.0 finally live!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2506440/extras/94e058697553d91f123bb054dc7e01d7.poster.avif?t=1767655503\" width=600 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2506440/extras/94e058697553d91f123bb054dc7e01d7.webm?t=1767655503\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Old-school 2D fantasy open world MMORPG</strong></i> - all the basic stuff you'd expect, monsters, loot, player trading, auction houses, achievements, guilds, professions, and so on. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>5 classes</strong></i> - play as a fighter, a priest, a sorcerer, a paladin, or a witch, each with 3 unique talent trees and 150+ talents in total.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>350+ quests</strong></i> - you can reach maximum levels by doing quests, solo or in a party.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>8 instance dungeons</strong></i> - bring friends to tackle these challenges for unique rare loot.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Optional PVP</strong></i> - don't worry, you won't be ganked.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>No pay-to-win (ever!)</strong></i> - the price of the game is what you see on the tin.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Mix of handcrafted and generated worlds and dungeons</strong></i> - every day Junjun the Portal Master will open up a gateway to another world that has never been visited before. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Gods and deities</strong></i> - discover new deities, show your allegiance to them and they'll reward you. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Optional offline mode and custom servers</strong></i> - play locally without internet connection or run your own servers. </p></li></ul>",
